      "title": {
        "en": "W Tatrach, w Tatry"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Mountains keep *w* for both questions. *Gdzie?* takes the locative: *jestem w Tatrach, w górach*. *Dokąd?* takes the accusative: *jadę w Tatry, w góry*. Poland has *Tatry* with Zakopane, the quieter *Beskidy*, *Sudety* in the south-west and *Bieszczady* in the south-east. In winter you go *na narty*, skiing."
      },
